{"step_index":107,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-30T00:50:07Z","thinking":"The file contains data where newly modified or entered cells are marked with a red font color, which applies to various fields like business registration number, founding year, representative's name, closure date, and remarks. The presence of 346 already verified rows suggests ongoing data validation or update activity within this dataset. Understanding the red font color convention is critical for interpreting the data's current state.\n\n\nThe user is asking to recall and apply a specific format to a file before its final submission. The request focuses on highlighting modifications made during the last verification and input stage within the specified Excel file. The intended highlighting color is red.\n\n\nReviewing the provided list of company entries and data updates is essential, especially the entries added and modified since September 29th for the Chuseok final submission preparation. The goal is to check whether these entries were already incorporated into the Excel file. Performing a direct comparison between the list and the Excel data is needed, to confirm the latest edits are reflected.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"& \"C:\\Users\\lg\\.local\\bin\\python3.11.exe\" -c \"\nimport openpyxl, sys\nsys.stdout.reconfigure(encoding='utf-8')\n\nfpath = r'C:\\Users\\lg\\Desktop\\Today\\(안상숙)(STI)_(모집단현행화)_부산정보산업진흥원_2026_부산_CT산업_실태조사_260910_크레탑_배현명.xlsx'\nwb = openpyxl.load_workbook(fpath)\nws = wb['기업체 리스트']\n\ncheck_names = [\n    '무몽크', '불교텔레비젼', '불교텔레비전', '비문', '위플라이엔터테인먼트', '위플라이',\n    '조나단', '이은석', '족보만드는곳족보관', '족보관', '창작집단1407',\n    '이수연', '이지현', '이진수', '작은통일출판사', '작은통일',\n    '동화사', '블루레코딩', '희웹툰', '우수경',\n    '운도게임스튜디오', '와라봐라', '조은글방', '엠에스네트워크', '스튜디오바다', '스튜디오더블린',\n    '케이엘정보통신', '불교방송', '우리누리', '에스아이에이', '인텔리코드', '투그램시스템즈', '메쉬링크', '지엠씨랩스', '위컴퍼니', '진엔터테인먼트', '에듀메타'\n]\n\nheaders = [ws.cell(1, c).value for c in range(1, ws.max_column+1)]\n\nprint('=== Detailed Inspection of target companies in 기업체 리스트 ===')\nfor r in range(2, ws.max_row+1):\n    cname = str(ws.cell(r, 3).value or '')\n    rep = str(ws.cell(r, 7).value or '')\n    for target in check_names:\n        if target in cname or (len(target) > 2 and target in rep):\n            print(f'\\n--- Row {r}: {cname} (Rep: {rep}) ---')\n            for c in range(1, ws.max_column+1):\n                cell = ws.cell(r, c)\n                if cell.value is not None:\n                    fc = cell.font.color.rgb if (cell.font and cell.font.color) else 'DEFAULT'\n                    print(f'  Col {c} [{headers[c-1]}]: {repr(cell.value)} | Font: {fc}')\n            break\n\"","Cwd":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\worktrees\\resilient-bardeen\\mark_modified_entries_red","IsDaemon":false,"WaitMsBeforeAsync":5000,"toolAction":"Inspecting all this week companies in Excel","toolSummary":"Inspect this week companies in Excel"}}]}
